212 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 45 0 R
/E (        GEOD has a fixed supply of one billion tokens, and no more will ever be minted. According to Blockworks, investors are already fully unlocked and only 5.7% of supply is left to vest, with the last large unlock on November 28, 2026. Burns have also permanently removed about 72 million GEOD. And because buybacks are set in dollars rather than tokens, about $9.0 million a year, a falling price actually means more tokens get burned.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [30]
>>
endobj
